### ============================================
### F06 — Integracao com WhatsApp
### ============================================
### Variaveis necessarias:
###   {{base_url}}     = http://localhost:8080
###   {{tenant_token}} = JWT com tenant_id selecionado

### --- Pagina principal (QR ou conversas) ---

### Pagina principal do WhatsApp
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Conexao ---

### Obter QR code para conexao
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/qr
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Status da conexao WhatsApp
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/status
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Iniciar conexao
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/connect
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Desconectar WhatsApp
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/disconnect
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Conversas ---

### Listar conversas do tenant
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Listar conversas com busca
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations?search=maria
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Listar conversas paginadas
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations?page=2
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Chat ---

### Abrir conversa (mensagens)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Polling de novas mensagens (fallback SSE)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages/new?after={{last_message_id}}
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Enviar mensagem
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=Ola, como posso ajuda-lo?

### --- SSE (tempo real) ---

### Stream unificado de eventos SSE (F26: uma conexão por página)
# Emite "notification" (fragmento HTML) e encaminha new-message, conversation-update, lead-*.
# Substitui /tenant/whatsapp/events e /notifications/stream.
# curl -N -H "Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}" {{base_url}}/tenant/stream
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/stream
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### --- Notas do cliente (F24) ---

### Painel de notas da conversa (lead atual)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/notes
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### Adicionar nota ao lead atual da conversa
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/notes
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=Cliente pediu retorno na proxima semana.

### ============================================
### Testes OWASP
### ============================================

### A01 — Sem token (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp

### A01 — Sem tenant selecionado (deve retornar 403)
# Use um token sem tenant_id
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp
Cookie: token={{admin_token_sem_tenant}}

### A03 — SQL injection na busca (deve retornar 200 sem erro)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations?search=' OR 1=1 --
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}

### A03 — XSS no envio de mensagem (template deve escapar)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/messages
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=<script>alert('xss')</script>

### A03 — XSS no conteudo da nota (template deve escapar)
POST {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp/conversations/{{conversation_id}}/notes
Cookie: token={{tenant_token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

content=<script>alert('xss')</script>

### A07 — Token invalido (deve retornar 401)
GET {{base_url}}/tenant/whatsapp
Cookie: token=invalid.token.here
